# fairydust is an unreleased, untagged rolling branch, so pin to a specific
# commit. version is the base kernel release (from the top-level Makefile) plus
# the commit's committer date as the snapshot marker; bump both _commit and the
# date suffix (and reset revision to 1) when advancing the snapshot.
# The GitHub archive is generated on the fly, so its gzip checksum is not stable;
# use the "@" content checksum (sha256 of the extracted tar) instead.
#
# NOTE: this block is the head of the generated template; everything below it
# comes from void-packages' srcpkgs/linux-asahi. Use ./gen.sh --bump to advance
# the snapshot rather than editing _commit/version/checksum by hand.
